  "Testimonials": [
    {
      "img": "img/testimonials/13.jpg",
      "text": "\"NMFB has really played a key role in advancing my business. From small savings to obtaining loans and lots more services that assisted me to achieve my goals. They are just the best in advancing the growth of small enterprenuers.\"",
      "name": "Alh. Bashir D. Suleiman.  CEO, Maikano Farms Ltd"
    },
    {
      "img": "img/testimonials/Hafsat.jpg",
      "text": "\"The bank brought some products that assisted us in collecting school fees without headache, the product also assisted the parents by giving them loans to pay off their annual fees easily at once, while they pay the bank gradually.\"",
      "name": "Haj Hafsat Sani.  Bursar, Prestige Group of Schools"
    },
    {
      "img": "img/testimonials/10.jpg",
      "text": "\"How I wish all banks could emulate the services of this bank. we are in a very remote area, where there is no network of telephone services, no motorable road and all the good things of modern life. Despite our state, the bank came to our rescue by providing loans in term of seedinglings, agro chemicals and also cash to assist us on our main business 'farming'. This year 2023 had been the best farming season as all the surrounding communities had good yield\"",
      "name": "Samuel Yusuf"
    },
    {
      "img": "img/testimonials/14.jpg",
      "text": "\"Iam a civil servant that initially moved my account to a Commercial bank for a big loan, but their stringent conditions drove me out: I have to come back to this bank, based on a simple reason that this type of bank is the only one that can assist low income earners",
      "name": "Rabi'at Usman"
    },
    {
      "img": "img/testimonials/15.jpg",
      "text": "\"One amazing issue with this bank is the agricultural machineries in their possession. They provided rice planter that plants my 20 hectares within few hours and also rice harvester that also carry out the cutting of the rice within few hours, saving us labour cost and time, apart from other machineries that really assisted us. .\"",
      "name": "Murjanatu Abdulkhadir"
    },
    {
      "img": "img/testimonials/07.jpg",
      "text": "\"I'am a community leader and every year I do resolve more than 100 demarcation cases. This bank has really assisted us by providing a ditcher that was used to demarcate all our community farms. I am here with my community elders to thank them.\"",
      "name": "Musa Shu'aibu"
    }
  ],
